# Files excluded from the release source zip (built with `git archive` in .github/workflows/release.yml).
docs/DEVELOPMENT.md export-ignore
# `specs` is a symlink into the specs-specdriven submodule, which no release
# ships (`git archive` leaves a submodule out, as an empty folder). Left in,
# it unpacks as a dangling link that stops the desktop build (electron-builder
# stats every path in the project) — and nothing in the app reads it at runtime.
# Anchored to the root: an unanchored `specs` matches at every depth, and would
# strip `demo-data/specs/` (the demo's feature files, and their Automerge docs
# under `demo-data/.specdriven/automerge/specs/`) from the release zip
# and from the GitHub archive the demo container is built from — the demo then
# opens with "No feature files yet".
/specs export-ignore
# The submodule itself and its config: an empty folder and a pointer to it.
/specs-specdriven export-ignore
/.gitmodules export-ignore
